      "name": "request_advance_onchain",
      "description": "Production credit issuance path. Returns calldata for the agent to call CreditFacilityV1.requestAdvance(oracle, receivableId, amount, maxFeeBps) directly on-chain. The contract enforces credit score, exposure limits, receivable verification, the utilization-curve fee (quoted live; the tx reverts above maxFeeBps so you never pay over quote), and pool utilization. No operator approval is possible. Register the receivable on a claim oracle first (see /claims/* routes) to obtain the receivableId.",
